  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e6be890c8a758f3488227c7687955d0c, type: 3}
  m_Name: HeroMonolith
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TaleStoneData
  DialogueLines:
  - textVI: "\"Khi vi\xEAn g\u1EA1ch cu\u1ED1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7t
      xu\u1ED1ng, anh h\xF9ng s\u1EBD xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n.\""
    textEN: '"When the final brick is laid, the hero shall emerge."'
    AutoSkip: 0
  - textVI: "\u0110\xF3 l\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\u1EABn truy\u1EC1n
      tai nhau. Th\u1EBF r\u1ED3i ai c\u0169ng ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1EE3i... Ch\u1EDD
      m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\xE1c \u0111\u1EB7t n\xF3. "
    textEN: That is what the people whispered to one another. And so, everyone waited...
      waiting for someone else to lay it.
    AutoSkip: 0
  - textVI: "Vi\xEAn g\u1EA1ch cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng ch\u01B0a t\u1EEBng bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t.
      N\xF3 v\u1EABn \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y, ch\u1EDD m\u1ED9t \u0111\xF4i tay \u0111\u1EE7
      can \u0111\u1EA3m. Th\u1EE9 \u0111ang thi\u1EBFu... ch\u01B0a bao gi\u1EDD
      l\xE0 vi\xEAn g\u1EA1ch.\n"
    textEN: The final brick never truly vanished. It has always been here, waiting
      for hands courageous enough to lift it. What was missing... was never the brick.
    AutoSkip: 0
  AutoProgressDelay: 1.5
  TypingSpeed: 0.05
  IsActivated: 0
  IsKingMonolith: 0
  IsHeroMonolith: 1
